  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C.\n• Cut red onion into wedges.\n• Add onion and carrot & zucchini mix to a lined oven tray and drizzle with olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64c89981459aba500a5fae84-149ccf7e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are cooking, cut haloumi into 1cm thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• In a large bowl, combine garlic aioli, Dijon mustard, the balsamic vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on a second lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64c89981459aba500a5fae84-b661fa42.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, slice cucumber.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64c89981459aba500a5fae84-402add5e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add baby spinach leaves, cucumber, roasted veggies and croutons to the dressing bowl and toss to combine. Season to taste.\n• Divide the crouton veggie salad between plates and top with the honey haloumi and flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64c89981459aba500a5fae84-40c386a2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
